Package: foot
Version: @DEB_FOOT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/dnkl/foot
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libpixman-1-0, libfontconfig1, libfcft4, libutf8proc3, libepoll-shim0
Replaces: ncurses-term
Description: Fast, lightweight and minimalistic Wayland terminal emulator
 foot is a fast, lightweight Wayland terminal emulator with no toolkit
 dependency: it rasterizes glyphs itself (via fcft) and presents through
 wl_shm. Ships the foot server, footclient, terminfo, and color themes.
 Runs as a native Wayland client under the iosc compositor.
